    "referenced_message": {
      "type": 0,
      "content": "First, set Proton to a recent GE-Proton Version (I used GE-Proton-10.25)\nNext, set your launch options as such: `PROTON_ENABLE_WAYLAND=1 %command% --disable-gpu --disable-gpu-compositing --enable-software-rasterizer`\n\nThis should give a *significant* performance boost. I dunno if or how well this works on Windows. I don't know if Steam on WIndows lets you access launch options and the Windows version doesn't use Proton so the `PROTON_ENABLE_WAYLAND=1 %command%` won't do anything. The rest may help, try at your own discretion if its possible.",
